@startuml architecture
!include style.iuml
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80

actor "Client / staff" as User
node "Keycloak 26\nrealm car-dealer" as Keycloak

component "order-service\n:8080\n\norders · test drives\nclients · managers" as OS
component "storage-service\n:8081 · gRPC :9090\n\ninventory · configurator\nassembly orders" as SS

queue "Kafka\n\norder.sent-for-approval\norder.canceled\norder.approval-result" as Kafka

database "order_db\n(PostgreSQL)" as OrderDb
database "storage_db\n(PostgreSQL)" as StorageDb

User -right-> Keycloak : 1. get access token
User --> OS : REST + Bearer JWT
User --> SS : REST + Bearer JWT

OS -right-> SS : REST: car / configuration snapshot\ngRPC: available cars
OS ..> Keycloak : verify JWT\n(JWKS)
SS ..> Keycloak : verify JWT\n(JWKS)

OS --> Kafka : approval requests,\ncancellations (outbox)
Kafka --> SS
SS --> Kafka : approval results (outbox)
Kafka --> OS

OS --> OrderDb
SS --> StorageDb

note bottom of OrderDb
  orders, test drives, users,
  outbox_events, processed_events
end note
note bottom of StorageDb
  car models, components, configurations,
  cars, spare parts, assembly orders,
  outbox_events, processed_events
end note
@enduml
